      "message": "fix(ui): keep a Geometry row's remove button in reach at the default window size\n\nThe × now comes first in each selection row, and the label takes the\nwidth that's left, shortened with \"…\" (full label on hover). At\n1280 × 800 the face row's × used to sit off-panel at x = 1406. Adds a\nUI test at the default window size that fails on the old layout.\n\nFixes #1688\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
